---
// Hero.astro - Responsive Mobile & Web Hero Section
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-4 sm:pt-8 pb-10 sm:pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-pink-50/70 via-purple-50/40 to-milalu-cream">
  <!-- Círculos decorativos de luz ambiental difuminada -->
  <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-72 h-72 lg:w-96 lg:h-96 bg-milalu-pink/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 -left-20 w-72 h-72 lg:w-96 lg:h-96 bg-milalu-purple/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-10 right-1/3 w-60 h-60 bg-milalu-yellow/20 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Columna Izquierda: Mensaje principal y Llamados a la acción (Texto) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-center lg:text-left">
        <!-- Badge superior -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/90 border border-pink-200/70 text-xs text-milalu-pink font-semibold mb-4 shadow-xs">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 flex-shrink-0 fill-current text-milalu-pink" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2L14.2 9.8L22 12L14.2 14.2L12 22L9.8 14.2L2 12L9.8 9.8L12 2Z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Sueña • Crea • Personaliza</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-bubble text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-[1.12] text-milalu-dark">
          Detalles que hacen <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-[#FE8EC8] drop-shadow-xs">
            la vida más bonita
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-milalu-muted font-normal max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
          Transformamos tus ideas, fotos familiares y frases favoritas en tazas, termos, playeras y regalos únicos con sublimación de alta definición.
          <strong class="font-semibold text-milalu-dark block sm:inline mt-1 sm:mt-0"> ¡Tú imaginas, nosotros lo hacemos realidad!</strong>
        </p>

        <!-- Botones de Acción (CTA) adaptados a celular y escritorio -->
        <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <a
            href="#catalogo"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-milalu-pink to-milalu-pink-dark hover:from-milalu-pink-dark hover:to-milalu-pink text-white font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base px-7 py-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-button hover:shadow-lg transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Ver Catálogo de Diseños</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/5215500000000?text=%C2%A1Hola%20Milal%C3%BA!%20Me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20cotizar%20un%20dise%C3%B1o%20personalizado%20en%20Tijuana"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-white hover:bg-pink-50/60 text-milalu-dark font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-milalu-purple/30 hover:border-milalu-purple transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-xs"
          >
            <img src="/images/whatsapp-green.png" alt="WhatsApp" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain flex-shrink-0" width="20" height="20" />
            <span>Cotizar mi Idea por WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Badges de Confianza con Íconos Vectoriales SVG -->
        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-pink-200/50 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 text-left">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-2.5 sm:p-3 border border-pink-100 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-pink-50 text-milalu-pink flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/>
                <circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/>
                <circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/>
                <circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/>
                <path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.9 0 1.5-.7 1.5-1.5 0-.4-.2-.8-.4-1.1-.3-.3-.4-.7-.4-1.1 0-.8.7-1.5 1.5-1.5H16c3.3 0 6-2.7 6-6 0-5.5-4.5-8.8-10-8.8Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-milalu-dark leading-tight">Diseños únicos</p>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-milalu-muted">100% a tu gusto</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-2.5 sm:p-3 border border-purple-100 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 text-milalu-purple flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-milalu-dark leading-tight">Solo Tijuana</p>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-milalu-muted">Entrega personal</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-2.5 sm:p-3 border border-yellow-100 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M12 2l2.4 7.4h7.6l-6.1 4.5 2.3 7.1-6.2-4.5-6.2 4.5 2.3-7.1-6.1-4.5h7.6z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-milalu-dark leading-tight">Alta calidad</p>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-milalu-muted">Colores duraderos</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-2.5 sm:p-3 border border-rose-100 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 text-milalu-pink flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-milalu-dark leading-tight">Hecho con amor</p>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-milalu-muted">Cada detalle cuenta</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Columna Derecha: Tarjeta Visual de Productos & Marca -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative mt-4 lg:mt-0">
        <!-- Marco estético con sombra y bordes redondeados tipo app -->
        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-md lg:max-w-none bg-white rounded-3xl p-3 sm:p-4 border-2 border-pink-100 shadow-soft">
          
          <!-- Imagen de productos sublimados de Milalú -->
          <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-pink-50">
            <img
              src="/images/brand-board.jpg"
              alt="Muestra de productos sublimados de Milalú (Tazas, Termos y Playeras)"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              loading="eager"
            />
            
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-milalu-dark/40 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>

            <!-- Etiqueta sobre la imagen -->
            <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 flex items-center justify-between text-white text-xs font-semibold">
              <span class="bg-white/95 text-milalu-dark px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm text-[11px] font-bold">
                Tazas • Termos • Textil
              </span>
              <span class="bg-milalu-pink/95 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm text-[10px] flex items-center gap-1 font-medium">
                <span>Muestra Digital Gratis</span>
                <svg class="w-2.5 h-2.5 fill-current text-white inline" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M12 2L14.2 9.8L22 12L14.2 14.2L12 22L9.8 14.2L2 12L9.8 9.8L12 2Z"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pequeña franja informativa inferior de la tarjeta -->
          <div class="mt-3 px-2 py-1 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <img
                src="/images/logo.png"
                alt="Milalú"
                class="h-7 w-auto max-h-7 object-contain flex-shrink-0"
                height="28"
              />
              <span class="text-[11px] text-milalu-muted font-medium">Sublimación personalizada</span>
            </div>

            <a
              href="#catalogo"
              class="text-xs font-bold text-milalu-pink hover:underline flex items-center gap-1"
            >
              <span>Ver modelos</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Badge flotante exterior decorativo -->
          <div class="absolute -top-3 -right-3 bg-white text-milalu-purple px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold shadow-md border border-purple-100 flex items-center gap-1.5 animate-bounce">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current text-milalu-purple" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 2L14.2 9.8L22 12L14.2 14.2L12 22L9.8 14.2L2 12L9.8 9.8L12 2Z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Sublimación HD</span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
